
Package: finalproject
Title: Comparative Analysis of Anthropometric Measurements
Version: 0.0.2
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Tongtong",
           family = "Gu",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "tongtonggu@hsph.harvard.edu")
Description: This project investigates anthropometric measurements
    using the Mendeley Body Measurements dataset and the National
    Health and Nutrition Examination Survey (NHANES). It examines
    patterns in age, height, and waist circumference through
    descriptive statistics and data visualization. The project
    also explores data quality, measurement differences, and
    challenges associated with comparing heterogeneous datasets.
Depends: R (>= 4.5.0)
